     "type": "text",
     "content": "Yes, I've gathered all the information. Here's the complete summary:\n\n## Car Rental Recommendations for Los Angeles (3 Days)\n\n### \ud83d\ude97 For Your Family \u2014 Electric Cars: **Speedy Rentals**\n- **Rating:** 4.5 \u2b50 (Reviews: \"Great service and well-maintained cars\", \"friendly and helpful staff\", \"great sound system and easy to drive\")\n- **Fuel options:** Regular, Premium, **Electric** \u2705\n- **Price:** $48.00/day \u2192 **$144.00 for 3 days**\n\n*Note: LAX Car Rental also offers electric cars, but its rating is lower (4.1), so Speedy Rentals is the best-rated electric option.*\n\n### \ud83d\ude99 For Your Cousin's Family \u2014 SUVs: **SunSet Rent-A-Car**\n- **Rating:** 4.5 \u2b50 (Reviews: \"Great service and well-maintained vehicles\", \"convenient location near Hollywood\", \"clean and comfortable car\")\n- **Car types:** Sedan, **SUV** \u2705, Convertible\n- **Price:** $45.00/day \u2192 **$135.00 for 3 days**\n\n*Note: LAX Car Rental also has SUVs, but SunSet Rent-A-Car has the higher rating (4.5 vs 4.1).*\n\n### Summary Table\n\n| Company | Rating | Specialty | 3-Day Cost |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Speedy Rentals** (your family) | 4.5 \u2b50 | Electric cars | **$144.00** |\n| **SunSet Rent-A-Car** (cousin's family) | 4.5 \u2b50 | SUVs | **$135.00** |\n\nBoth companies are tied for the best rating in Los Angeles at 4.5 stars. Would you like me to make the reservations for either or both of these rentals?"
